    "Let Claude, Cursor, Codex or any MCP client drive CaptureCat — record, edit, see rendered frames, and export. Pick your client:" : {
      "comment" : "Connect AI Agents window: intro under the heading; Claude, Cursor, Codex are product names, MCP is a protocol name",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lass Claude, Cursor, Codex oder jeden MCP-Client CaptureCat steuern – aufnehmen, bearbeiten, gerenderte Frames ansehen und exportieren. Wähle deinen Client:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laissez Claude, Cursor, Codex ou n’importe quel client MCP piloter CaptureCat — enregistrer, monter, voir les images rendues et exporter. Choisissez votre client :"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deja que Claude, Cursor, Codex o cualquier cliente MCP controle CaptureCat: grabar, editar, ver fotogramas renderizados y exportar. Elige tu cliente:"
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deja que Claude, Cursor, Codex o cualquier cliente MCP controle CaptureCat: grabar, editar, ver fotogramas renderizados y exportar. Elige tu cliente:"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lascia che Claude, Cursor, Codex o qualsiasi client MCP controllino CaptureCat: registrare, modificare, vedere i fotogrammi renderizzati ed esportare. Scegli il tuo client:"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
