    },
    "New share videos will upload to CaptureCat storage. Nothing is stored in “%@” yet." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ Storage: disconnect confirmation message, bucket empty; the value is the bucket name",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neue Freigabevideos werden in den CaptureCat-Speicher hochgeladen. In „%@“ ist noch nichts gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les nouvelles vidéos partagées seront téléversées dans le stockage CaptureCat. Rien n’est encore stocké dans « %@ »."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los nuevos vídeos compartidos se subirán al almacenamiento de CaptureCat. Aún no hay nada guardado en “%@”."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los nuevos videos compartidos se subirán al almacenamiento de CaptureCat. Aún no hay nada guardado en “%@”."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I nuovi video condivisi verranno caricati nello spazio di archiviazione di CaptureCat. In “%@” non c'è ancora nulla."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Novos vídeos compartilhados serão enviados para o armazenamento do CaptureCat. Nada está guardado em “%@” ainda."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nieuwe deelvideo's worden geüpload naar CaptureCat-opslag. Er staat nog niets in ‘%@’."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しい共有ビデオはCaptureCatのストレージにアップロードされます。「%@」にはまだ何も保存されていません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "새 공유 비디오는 CaptureCat 저장 공간에 업로드됩니다. “%@”에는 아직 저장된 항목이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的共享视频将上传到 CaptureCat 储存空间。“%@”中尚未储存任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New share videos will upload to CaptureCat storage. The %lld videos already in “%@” keep playing from your bucket, so CaptureCat keeps its access key until they're deleted." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ Storage: disconnect confirmation message; the number is how many videos are stored, the value is the bucket name",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neue Freigabevideos werden in den CaptureCat-Speicher hochgeladen. Die %lld Videos, die bereits in „%@“ liegen, werden weiter aus deinem Bucket abgespielt, daher behält CaptureCat den Zugriffsschlüssel, bis sie gelöscht sind."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les nouvelles vidéos partagées seront téléversées dans le stockage CaptureCat. Les %lld vidéos déjà présentes dans « %@ » restent lues depuis votre bucket ; CaptureCat conserve donc sa clé d’accès jusqu’à leur suppression."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los nuevos vídeos compartidos se subirán al almacenamiento de CaptureCat. Los %lld vídeos que ya están en “%@” se siguen reproduciendo desde tu bucket, así que CaptureCat conserva su clave de acceso hasta que se eliminen."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los nuevos videos compartidos se subirán al almacenamiento de CaptureCat. Los %lld videos que ya están en “%@” se siguen reproduciendo desde tu bucket, así que CaptureCat conserva su clave de acceso hasta que se eliminen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I nuovi video condivisi verranno caricati nello spazio di archiviazione di CaptureCat. I %lld video già presenti in “%@” continuano a essere riprodotti dal tuo bucket, quindi CaptureCat conserva la chiave di accesso finché non vengono eliminati."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Novos vídeos compartilhados serão enviados para o armazenamento do CaptureCat. Os %lld vídeos que já estão em “%@” continuam sendo reproduzidos do seu bucket, então o CaptureCat mantém a chave de acesso até eles serem apagados."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nieuwe deelvideo's worden geüpload naar CaptureCat-opslag. De %lld video's die al in ‘%@’ staan, blijven afspelen vanuit je bucket, dus CaptureCat houdt de toegangssleutel totdat ze zijn verwijderd."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しい共有ビデオはCaptureCatのストレージにアップロードされます。「%2$@」にすでにある%1$lld本のビデオは引き続きバケットから再生されるため、それらが削除されるまでCaptureCatはアクセスキーを保持します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "새 공유 비디오는 CaptureCat 저장 공간에 업로드됩니다. “%2$@”에 이미 있는 비디오 %1$lld개는 버킷에서 계속 재생되므로, 삭제될 때까지 CaptureCat이 액세스 키를 보관합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的共享视频将上传到 CaptureCat 储存空间。“%2$@”中已有的 %1$lld 个视频仍从你的存储桶播放，因此 CaptureCat 会保留其访问密钥，直到这些视频被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New share videos will upload to CaptureCat storage. The 1 video already in “%@” keep playing from your bucket, so CaptureCat keeps its access key until they're deleted." : {
